# ===== AETTA vendored code: keep the source, exclude data/caches/checkpoints =====
# (58 tracked source files under AETTA/ -- *.py/*.md/*.txt/*.yml/*.sh -- are NOT
#  matched by these rules and remain tracked. Only heavy regenerable payloads are
#  excluded, per the storage policy in docs/research/kbound/STORAGE_MANIFEST.json.)
